@startuml
title Projeto Xadrez - Deployment View

node "Dispositivo do jogador" as client {
  artifact "Frontend Godot" as frontend
}

node "Servidor da aplicação" as apphost {
  node "Container Backend" as backend {
    artifact "Spring Boot JAR" as jar
  }
  node "Container IA" as aicontainer {
    artifact "Worker + motor IA" as ai
  }
}

node "Banco de dados" as dbhost {
  database "PostgreSQL" as db
}

frontend --> jar : HTTPS / WebSocket
jar --> db : SQL/JPA
ai --> jar : HTTP/JSON\n/next e /result

note bottom of apphost
Nós são lógicos: Backend, IA e PostgreSQL
podem ser colocados na mesma máquina.
end note
@enduml
